<details class="imagex-panel" id="imagex">
  <summary>Advice and questions with imageX <span>· optional · Hermes</span></summary>
  <header class="imagex-heading">
    <div><p class="image-eyebrow">CREATION HELP</p><h2 id="imagex-title">imageX <span>Powered by Hermes</span></h2>
      <p>Ask a question about a recipe, an idea or an edit. To create, use the Workshop brief.</p></div>
    <div class="imagex-presence"><span id="imagex-connection">Connecting to Hermes…</span><a href="#imagex-dashboard">See its workshop ↓</a>
      <a id="imagex-official-dashboard" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" hidden>Official Hermes dashboard · imageX ↗</a></div>
  </header>
  <details class="imagex-role-details"><summary>Who does what? Hermes, AgentX and the local engine</summary><div class="imagex-roles">
    <div><span>01 · HERMES</span><strong>Imagines and advises</strong><p>imageX discusses, refines prompts and proposes a recipe.</p></div>
    <div><span>02 · AGENTX</span><strong>Coordinates and keeps</strong><p>The Workshop keeps the exchanges, validates the requests and archives the creations.</p></div>
    <div><span>03 · LOCAL COMFYUI</span><strong>Produces the images</strong><p id="imagex-renderer">The render engine uses the GPU configured by AgentX.</p></div>
  </div>
  </details>
  <div class="imagex-workspace">
    <section class="imagex-chat" aria-labelledby="imagex-chat-title">
      <div class="imagex-section-heading"><h3 id="imagex-chat-title">With imageX</h3><button id="imagex-new" type="button" class="quiet-button">New discussion</button></div>
      <label class="imagex-history-label" for="imagex-session">Discussions in this Workshop</label>
      <select id="imagex-session"><option value="">New discussion</option></select>
      <div id="imagex-messages" class="imagex-messages" role="log" aria-live="polite">
        <p class="imagex-welcome">A question about style, a recipe or an edit? imageX can advise you. Your image is prepared in the brief.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="imagex-shortcuts"><button id="imagex-explore" type="button">Explore the possibilities</button><button id="imagex-tab-proposal" type="button">Review the proposal next to the brief</button></div>
      <form id="imagex-chat-form"><label for="imagex-message">A question for imageX</label>
        <textarea id="imagex-message" rows="2" aria-describedby="imagex-message-counter" placeholder="An idea, some advice, a question about your edit…" required></textarea>
        <p id="imagex-message-counter" class="image-help" role="status">Message: 0 / 32,000 characters.</p>
        <div class="imagex-send-row"><p>The brief’s text and settings are sent. Attached images stay reserved for the local render.</p><button id="imagex-send" type="submit">Send ↗</button></div>
      </form>
      <p id="imagex-chat-notice" class="image-help" role="status"></p>
    </section>
    <section class="imagex-dashboard" id="imagex-dashboard" aria-labelledby="imagex-dashboard-title">
      <div class="imagex-section-heading"><h3 id="imagex-dashboard-title">The specialist’s workshop</h3><span class="imagex-badge">HERMES · imageX</span></div>
      <dl id="imagex-routing" class="imagex-routing"></dl>
      <p class="image-help">The official dashboard manages Hermes sessions, memory, skills and configuration. The discussions of this Workshop stay kept in AgentX.</p>
      <div class="imagex-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Specialist tools">
        <button id="imagex-tab-activity" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="true" aria-controls="imagex-activity">Console</button>
        <button id="imagex-tab-files" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="imagex-files" tabindex="-1">Files &amp; prompts</button>
      </div>
      <div id="imagex-activity" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="imagex-tab-activity">
        <p class="image-help">Activity of the selected consultation: tools, timings and result.</p>
        <select id="imagex-inspect-turn" aria-label="Consultation to inspect"><option value="">No consultation</option></select>
        <ol id="imagex-events" class="imagex-events"></ol>
        <p id="imagex-receipt" class="image-help"></p>
        <details><summary>Message and context sent</summary><pre id="imagex-envelope"></pre></details>
      </div>
      <div id="imagex-files" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="imagex-tab-files" hidden>
        <p class="image-help">The documents used by imageX. Their content and date come from the installed profile.</p>
        <label for="imagex-resource">Open a document</label><select id="imagex-resource"><option value="">Choose a file…</option></select>
        <p id="imagex-file-facts" class="image-help" role="status"></p><pre id="imagex-file-content"></pre>
        <a id="imagex-file-download" class="quiet-button" hidden>Download this document</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</details>
